      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَثُلَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَثُلَ</span></b> ; (Lth, Msb, K;) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَثِلَ</span>,
aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَثَلَ</span></b> ; (K;) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُثُولَةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَثَالَةٌ</span>; (Msb, K;)
both of the former verb; (Msb, TA;) [but both
mentioned in the S as simple substs.;] <i>It was,</i>
or <i>became, such as is termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَثْلٌ</span>, explained
below. (Msb, K.)

